Standard Exclusions - The Company shall not be liable under this Policy for:
1. Payment of Deductible – whether imposed or compulsory as specified in the Schedule;
2. Any claim arising within ‘Time Excessʼ as specified in the Policy Schedule;
3. Any loss or damage due to adulterated fuel in any form & usages of non distinctive fuel as mentioned in the
ownerʼs manual;
4. Any repairs/replacement on account of mechanical, electronic or electrical failure existing before the
commencement of Period of Insurance and was made good or repaired/replaced by the Manufacturer and
the current event is evident to be arisen due to the said event irrespective of when the failure actually
occurred.
5. Break down due to:
I. ‘Act of God Perilsʼ such as Flood, Earthquake, Storm, Typhoon, Inundation, Cyclone etc.;
II. Riot, Strike, Malicious and Terrorism Damage;
III. Any willful act, neglect or negligence of Policyholder;

